WEBVTT

00:00:07.790 --> 00:00:10.290
Utilizing otherworlders is a designated taboo.

00:00:10.790 --> 00:00:13.790
Using the human body as material is also taboo.

00:00:14.170 --> 00:00:16.250
Now that you have committed these offenses...

00:00:16.750 --> 00:00:18.210
I must kill you.

00:00:28.040 --> 00:00:31.000
Flare's successor, Flarette...

00:00:31.000 --> 00:00:36.420
The blank white material you once were
has become so much like that girl.

00:00:36.420 --> 00:00:41.250
I've waited eagerly these past ten
years for you to grow into your own.

00:00:41.750 --> 00:00:47.000
All the while conducting repeated
experiments on erasing personalities.

00:00:50.460 --> 00:00:51.920
Oh, that's right.

00:00:51.920 --> 00:00:56.130
One time, I went too far and blanched
part of the Pure Concept itself,

00:00:56.130 --> 00:00:58.080
which was quite the disaster.

00:00:58.540 --> 00:01:00.540
But you know about that all too well.

00:01:01.500 --> 00:01:08.420
I'm talking about the time an otherworlder's powers
turned a makeshift [White] and wiped out an entire town.

00:01:09.790 --> 00:01:11.580
Flare was the only one...

00:01:12.040 --> 00:01:14.750
Who suspected me at the time.

00:01:20.670 --> 00:01:23.080
You... did that?

00:01:23.540 --> 00:01:25.420
Are you surprised?

00:01:25.420 --> 00:01:29.420
You poor thing,
the girl who failed to share the fate of her hometown.

00:03:02.460 --> 00:03:06.750
<b>Episode 6:</b>

00:03:02.460 --> 00:03:06.750
<b><i>[Regression: Memories, Soul, Spirit]</i></b>

00:03:17.790 --> 00:03:21.500
Hey, Momo! What is this thing?! How do I kill it?

00:03:24.750 --> 00:03:25.420
Who knows?

00:03:25.750 --> 00:03:28.790
I assume it has something to do with original sin,

00:03:28.790 --> 00:03:31.670
but if you can't defeat it why don't you just let it kill you?

00:03:34.630 --> 00:03:36.960
I have to hurry and get to Menou!

00:03:39.710 --> 00:03:43.920
Don't worry, Otherworlder. You'll soon forget everything.

00:03:46.330 --> 00:03:47.330
No...

00:03:50.420 --> 00:03:51.630
I don't want that...

00:03:52.460 --> 00:03:54.210
Menou!

00:04:04.670 --> 00:04:07.130
<b><i>Auto Etheric Connect</i></b>

00:04:04.670 --> 00:04:07.130
<b><i>(Conditions: Met)-</i></b>

00:04:08.420 --> 00:04:11.580
<b><i>Improper Attachment, Pure Concept [Time]-</i></b>

00:04:08.420 --> 00:04:11.580
<b><i>Unlock [Regression: Memories, Soul, Spirit]</i></b>

00:04:19.790 --> 00:04:21.130
This place...

00:04:23.250 --> 00:04:26.210
Oh, right. It's the cathedral in Garm!

00:04:26.330 --> 00:04:27.630
Why you...

00:04:27.630 --> 00:04:28.920
Whoa!

00:04:31.880 --> 00:04:34.460
This is my present from Menou!

00:04:36.290 --> 00:04:39.790
I don't manage to get this that often.

00:04:39.880 --> 00:04:43.000
I'm warning you to stay still!
Do you want to experience more pain?!

00:04:45.130 --> 00:04:47.000
Then this is where I resist.

00:04:49.500 --> 00:04:51.210
<b><i>Etheric Connect</i></b>

00:04:56.920 --> 00:04:58.040
I'm sorry.

00:04:58.040 --> 00:05:01.920
I have no intention of going with
anyone other than Menou...

00:05:02.210 --> 00:05:06.540
But more importantly,
I absolutely refuse to let anyone but Menou kill me.

00:05:15.170 --> 00:05:18.040
No good, huh? It's still moving.

00:05:18.290 --> 00:05:21.710
I've never been able to stop this thing,
no matter how many times I try.

00:05:21.960 --> 00:05:23.130
I wonder why?

00:05:28.830 --> 00:05:33.130
I guess I don't have to rewind things this Time,
unlike back on the train.

00:05:35.500 --> 00:05:38.790
I guess the best thing to do is
have that girl wreak havoc?

00:05:39.330 --> 00:05:43.250
<b><i>Etheric Connect-Improper</i></b>

00:05:39.330 --> 00:05:43.250
<b><i>Attachment, Pure Concept [Time]-</i></b>

00:05:39.330 --> 00:05:43.250
<b><i>Double Invoke [Teleportation, Weathering]</i></b>

00:05:48.420 --> 00:05:50.000
Is this a little mean?

00:05:50.000 --> 00:05:52.750
But it's not really fair that she gets to have those ribbons.

00:05:53.040 --> 00:05:54.670
Sorry, Momo.

00:05:56.460 --> 00:05:58.330
Okay, time to do my thing again.

00:06:01.170 --> 00:06:05.080
It's okay. I'll leave a sense of déjà vu, as usual.

00:06:05.330 --> 00:06:08.330
And my love for Menou, of course.

00:06:08.670 --> 00:06:10.130
So there's nothing to be scared of.

00:06:17.670 --> 00:06:20.250
Wasn't I in a really bad situation?

00:06:20.790 --> 00:06:23.580
Well, whatever. I guess I managed to get out of it.

00:06:30.000 --> 00:06:32.580
Good grief. This is getting nowhere.

00:06:34.670 --> 00:06:36.170
<b><i>Barrier</i></b>

00:06:36.920 --> 00:06:38.500
What a pathetic flame!

00:06:38.500 --> 00:06:40.880
The barrier my robe provides is more than enough.

00:06:55.540 --> 00:06:56.380
Momo!

00:07:00.460 --> 00:07:01.920
I guess that killed her.

00:07:09.330 --> 00:07:11.790
Why? Why...?!

00:07:14.880 --> 00:07:16.960
I swear I protected them!

00:07:18.130 --> 00:07:19.130
So how...

00:07:19.330 --> 00:07:20.210
Momo...

00:07:20.630 --> 00:07:23.040
This... isn't fair...

00:07:23.210 --> 00:07:26.080
No, no, noooo!!

00:07:34.500 --> 00:07:37.670
I got them... from Menou...

00:07:37.670 --> 00:07:40.170
They're the world's most precious...

00:07:40.170 --> 00:07:42.420
Were the more precious...!

00:07:43.080 --> 00:07:44.630
You'll pay for this!

00:07:51.670 --> 00:07:55.130
Die, die, die, die! Just die!

00:08:00.000 --> 00:08:03.380
How dare you...! It's all your fault!

00:08:15.540 --> 00:08:17.130
Wh-what's this?!

00:08:17.380 --> 00:08:19.580
Momo! Not the earthen vein?!

00:08:19.580 --> 00:08:21.880
You can't, the entire castle will crumble on our heads!

00:08:21.880 --> 00:08:23.210
Shut up, keep out of this!

00:08:23.210 --> 00:08:23.880
Go die!

00:08:24.080 --> 00:08:26.630
I hate everyone! Except Menou.

00:08:26.630 --> 00:08:29.040
I love everything about her!

00:08:29.040 --> 00:08:33.330
So you'll pay for this! I swear. I swear!

00:08:33.330 --> 00:08:35.170
I hate you all! So much!

00:08:35.170 --> 00:08:38.290
Except for Menou, you can all just die!

00:08:57.250 --> 00:08:59.580
Wow Momo, you really went all out!

00:09:01.040 --> 00:09:05.000
I was wrong to hold back to preserve the castle.

00:09:05.210 --> 00:09:07.330
It's a den of corruption, anyway.

00:09:07.330 --> 00:09:09.500
Allow me to go full force on this thing.

00:09:20.830 --> 00:09:24.750
Stand back, riff-raff! I can't promise you won't get hurt!

00:09:25.500 --> 00:09:27.080
Now then, demon.

00:09:27.330 --> 00:09:29.830
Surely even you will die if I reduce you to nothing.

00:09:44.880 --> 00:09:48.250
Slashing through history is enthralling indeed!

00:09:54.920 --> 00:09:57.630
You're not being very aggressive, Ms. Menou.

00:09:57.630 --> 00:10:03.290
You're quite adept at controlling ether
but don't have much of it, do you?

00:10:03.880 --> 00:10:07.130
You'll eventually run out. What do you plan to do?

00:10:10.580 --> 00:10:16.130
She separated me from Menou,
and made these stupid things attack me...

00:10:16.330 --> 00:10:18.750
It's all... all because of...

00:10:16.420 --> 00:10:19.750
<b><i>Primary Red Gem</i></b>

00:10:16.420 --> 00:10:19.750
<b><i>Primary Pseudo-concept</i></b>

00:10:16.420 --> 00:10:19.750
<b><i>[Red]-Invoke [False Sun]</i></b>

00:10:22.580 --> 00:10:25.080
All because of that!

00:10:27.420 --> 00:10:29.540
I'll eliminate you!

00:10:41.420 --> 00:10:43.290
Someone broke the barrier?!

00:10:46.210 --> 00:10:49.040
You know, if there's one thing I can brag about...

00:10:50.750 --> 00:10:52.130
It's my aide.

00:10:52.330 --> 00:10:53.960
She's the world's most competent-

00:10:53.960 --> 00:10:55.170
Menou!

00:10:57.330 --> 00:10:59.170
I'm so glad you're safe!

00:10:59.750 --> 00:11:02.750
If anything happened to you, Menou...

00:11:04.710 --> 00:11:08.420
What the hell did you come here for, you dummy?!

00:11:19.460 --> 00:11:21.500
Why are you angry, Menou?

00:11:21.500 --> 00:11:23.420
Didn't I tell you to run?!

00:11:23.500 --> 00:11:24.420
I couldn't just leave you behind! I did the right thing!

00:11:24.420 --> 00:11:26.540
How did that girl get away?!
I couldn't just leave you behind! I did the right thing!<b></b>

00:11:26.540 --> 00:11:28.130
Will you just shut up?!

00:11:37.250 --> 00:11:39.130
Wait, what are you doing, Menou?!

00:11:39.670 --> 00:11:41.210
What just happened?!

00:11:45.500 --> 00:11:47.920
Did you just hear something that sounded like crying?

00:11:58.630 --> 00:12:00.500
Do you hear that awful sound?!

00:12:00.500 --> 00:12:05.080
Very competent, indeed, with copious amounts of ether.

00:12:05.080 --> 00:12:08.380
But at this rate, she'll wear herself out before long.

00:12:09.040 --> 00:12:12.420
I should still take care of you first, Ms. Menou.

00:12:12.790 --> 00:12:14.080
Honestly...

00:12:14.500 --> 00:12:18.540
Akari, why would you come when you
know it's going to be dangerous?

00:12:20.380 --> 00:12:25.500
Well, because the safest place I know in
this world is right by your side, Menou.

00:12:26.380 --> 00:12:30.790
You're such an idiot. But it's fine.
You've given me an idea.

00:12:33.000 --> 00:12:33.330
<b><i>Invoke</i></b>

00:12:33.330 --> 00:12:33.500
<b><i>[Bubble]</i></b>

00:12:33.540 --> 00:12:34.960
<b><i>[Bubble]</i></b>

00:12:45.670 --> 00:12:49.460
You and your diversions. Just like Flare.

00:12:49.460 --> 00:12:54.170
Did you intend to use the dregs of [Red]
left behind with what little ether you have?

00:12:54.170 --> 00:12:55.420
Very predictable.

00:12:55.500 --> 00:12:56.380
I suppose.

00:12:56.710 --> 00:12:58.920
But this is what I'm really after!

00:13:07.130 --> 00:13:09.080
I can't let my guard down for a second.

00:13:09.080 --> 00:13:11.880
It seems I should put an end to this now.

00:13:17.670 --> 00:13:18.960
Flare?!

00:13:19.380 --> 00:13:20.500
How?

00:13:20.920 --> 00:13:23.880
Don't tell me it was you disguised
as Ms. Menou all along,

00:13:23.880 --> 00:13:26.130
so that you could approach me?!

00:13:27.960 --> 00:13:31.670
You're right, I do love using diversions.

00:13:35.130 --> 00:13:36.290
Menou?!

00:13:37.380 --> 00:13:38.830
Etheric camouflage!

00:13:38.960 --> 00:13:41.170
Akari! I'm going to borrow your ether!

00:13:43.500 --> 00:13:43.920
<b><i>Invoke</i></b>

00:13:43.920 --> 00:13:44.080
<b><i>[Gale]</i></b>

00:13:48.920 --> 00:13:51.210
You have nothing protecting you now!

00:14:04.420 --> 00:14:06.630
Thank goodness I'm the archbishop!

00:14:06.920 --> 00:14:10.420
The magecraft built into this cathedral protected me!

00:14:10.710 --> 00:14:13.710
An automatic system to guard dignitaries...!

00:14:13.960 --> 00:14:16.580
You were so close, Ms. Menou.

00:14:17.210 --> 00:14:19.170
Now this is really it for you!

00:14:20.710 --> 00:14:22.130
I'm out of options.

00:14:22.710 --> 00:14:27.330
Except for the most dangerous one,
the one I most wanted to avoid...

00:14:28.920 --> 00:14:33.250
I have to use more than just Akari's ether,
but her Pure Concept itself,

00:14:33.250 --> 00:14:36.130
and dive deep into her consciousness to do so...

00:14:36.710 --> 00:14:40.380
Even if it's strictly forbidden, I have to!

00:14:44.000 --> 00:14:45.290
Menou...?

00:14:58.790 --> 00:15:00.170
It's swallowing me in...

00:15:06.330 --> 00:15:09.080
Where... am I?

00:15:12.330 --> 00:15:13.830
When is it?

00:15:20.290 --> 00:15:23.080
I failed to become a villain.

00:15:24.130 --> 00:15:30.580
A part of me never stopped longing to be a
priestess who was simply pure, just, and strong.

00:15:32.710 --> 00:15:38.830
Even though my life has only ever had
meaning on this dark red path I'm on.

00:15:51.500 --> 00:15:56.500
If I die now, can I go to that classroom over there?

00:15:59.500 --> 00:16:00.460
Don't worry.

00:16:06.130 --> 00:16:07.460
No matter what happens.

00:16:07.670 --> 00:16:11.330
No matter who does what,
and whatever Time it might be...

00:16:12.670 --> 00:16:15.290
I'll always be your best friend, Menou.

00:16:19.210 --> 00:16:20.420
Akari?

00:16:22.500 --> 00:16:25.290
You're right. Thanks, Akari!

00:16:28.460 --> 00:16:33.380
<b><i>Etheric Connect-Akari Tokitou,</i></b>

00:16:28.460 --> 00:16:33.380
<b><i>Pure Concept [Time]-Invoke [Aging]</i></b>

00:16:48.960 --> 00:16:52.420
Wh... why...?

00:16:54.630 --> 00:16:57.000
I'm different from you.

00:16:57.500 --> 00:17:04.130
I helped so many people... so I deserve to live...

00:17:05.420 --> 00:17:07.000
Archbishop Orwell.

00:17:07.380 --> 00:17:11.790
With such strong desire,
why didn't you use your scripture?

00:17:12.630 --> 00:17:15.080
Because I believed...

00:17:15.330 --> 00:17:22.830
That if I cast aside all that was just and pure,
I would find my own path to follow...

00:17:23.580 --> 00:17:29.500
Meaning I never found in my life
where I was nothing but righteous...

00:17:31.540 --> 00:17:33.380
Tell me, Ms. Menou.

00:17:33.540 --> 00:17:39.380
Your life has been the polar opposite of mine.
Do you have an answer?

00:17:41.880 --> 00:17:43.380
I don't.

00:17:43.830 --> 00:17:44.920
I've...

00:17:45.420 --> 00:17:47.170
From the very beginning, I've-

00:18:03.080 --> 00:18:06.130
You've worn yourself out after your little rampage, hmm?

00:18:07.210 --> 00:18:10.710
I quite enjoyed fighting alongside you, Momo.

00:18:19.170 --> 00:18:22.170
A dragon and a demon suddenly
emerged from underground,

00:18:22.170 --> 00:18:27.040
and the Princess Knight Ashuna Grisarika
defeated them with the help of a priestess.

00:18:27.420 --> 00:18:31.380
In the midst of it all,
Archbishop Orwell was killed in battle.

00:18:31.380 --> 00:18:33.540
That was the story told to the public.

00:18:34.380 --> 00:18:41.420
The archbishop's heretical crimes have been
concealed by the Church's higher ups,

00:18:41.420 --> 00:18:44.000
never to be uncovered again, I imagine.

00:18:44.630 --> 00:18:47.420
I-I'm so sorry, Menou.

00:18:47.670 --> 00:18:49.380
What do you mean, Momo?

00:18:49.540 --> 00:18:55.580
Um, the ribbons you gave me...
Th-they burned away...

00:18:55.580 --> 00:19:00.830
When they were a gift from you I treasured
more than anything in the world...

00:19:01.580 --> 00:19:04.290
Momo, turn around and close your eyes.

00:19:09.960 --> 00:19:11.960
You look cute, Momo.

00:19:11.960 --> 00:19:13.130
Menou...

00:19:13.290 --> 00:19:18.580
How do you always give me what
I want when I need it most?

00:19:18.920 --> 00:19:20.000
Who knows?

00:19:20.000 --> 00:19:22.500
Because I'm your mentor, perhaps?

00:19:23.210 --> 00:19:24.880
I love you so much!

00:19:25.750 --> 00:19:29.920
The only person I love in the whole wide world is you!

00:19:31.420 --> 00:19:36.380
I think Akari must have regressed back from
a future far beyond this point in time.

00:19:36.540 --> 00:19:41.460
But even though she forgot
everything from before she regressed,

00:19:41.460 --> 00:19:43.330
her affection for me remained somehow.

00:19:43.750 --> 00:19:48.880
So you think that's why the girl
trusted you from the beginning?

00:19:49.130 --> 00:19:50.330
Probably.

00:19:50.330 --> 00:19:54.380
That's what I sensed when I made contact with
the depths of her soul and consciousness.

00:19:55.250 --> 00:20:00.420
My future self managed to deceive
Akari so well to earn that much trust,

00:20:00.420 --> 00:20:05.040
but I must have failed to kill her for some
reason and allowed her to regress back.

00:20:05.710 --> 00:20:07.080
So I've made up my mind.

00:20:08.420 --> 00:20:15.170
I'm going to keep going on this journey with Akari,
in order to find a way to kill her.

00:20:19.290 --> 00:20:21.880
No, Menou...

00:20:21.880 --> 00:20:23.790
No... No!

00:20:24.040 --> 00:20:25.420
Menou!

00:20:25.670 --> 00:20:27.170
What is it, Akari?

00:20:27.750 --> 00:20:29.210
You're finally up?

00:20:36.210 --> 00:20:37.130
Akari?

00:20:37.380 --> 00:20:38.540
Menou!

00:20:38.880 --> 00:20:40.040
What's wrong?

00:20:40.290 --> 00:20:43.080
I just... had a nightmare.

00:20:43.080 --> 00:20:45.210
A nightmare? What kind?

00:20:45.460 --> 00:20:46.540
I don't know.

00:20:46.540 --> 00:20:50.960
I don't know, but I love you so much, Menou.

00:20:51.170 --> 00:20:53.830
Fine, fine. You're very welcome.

00:20:58.330 --> 00:20:59.460
I'm sorry.

00:20:59.460 --> 00:21:00.750
You should know...

00:21:00.750 --> 00:21:02.920
I was trying to kill you.

00:21:07.170 --> 00:21:11.580
That would have been fine.
You should have just killed me!

00:21:11.830 --> 00:21:16.290
No way. Not when I finally learned... what friendship is.

00:21:16.380 --> 00:21:18.170
No, Menou!

00:21:25.630 --> 00:21:28.130
Menou...!

00:21:33.170 --> 00:21:36.710
No. If this is how things end...

00:21:41.250 --> 00:21:46.790
If I'm going to be killed by the likes of her,
I wanted Menou to kill me instead.

00:21:47.290 --> 00:21:50.170
So long, you incomplete concept of Time.

00:22:00.170 --> 00:22:03.670
So please, make sure you kill me properly this time...

00:22:04.500 --> 00:22:05.710
Menou.

00:23:35.880 --> 00:23:39.380
<b>Next Episode</b>

00:23:35.880 --> 00:23:39.380
<b>Port City of Libelle</b>

00:23:36.420 --> 00:23:39.380
Next episode: Port City of Libelle.
